{"quest_id": 4360, "name": "密林の防衛戦", "description": "魔神の復活を阻止するため、\n封印を守る部族の村を訪れた王子たち。\n襲いくる教団員たちから村を守れ！\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "event": "風水士と紅の教団", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920049, "map_no": 3606, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 900.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2101536, "race_id": 16, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 316, "global_id": 315, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 15, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097632, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 35, "global_id": 34, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 109, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097696, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 39, "global_id": 38, "spawn_sec": 38}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "そら、これがご希望の魔神の骨片だ。", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "確かに。これは我が主の体の一部。\nさすがは封印の一族の長ミトラ。話が早いな。\nふふふ、また復活に一歩近づいた……。", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "受け取ったならもうこの土地に用はないはずだ。\nさっさと去ってもらおうか。", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "いや、貴様にはまだやってもらうことがある。\n伝説の英雄にゆかりのあるものならば、その命、\n魔神ロノベ様復活のよりしろとして捧げてもらう！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "なんだと！？　あたしらを騙したのか……！！", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　村が魔神の信徒たちに襲われています！\n一刻も早く助けましょう！", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}, {"name": "教団員", "text": "なっ、貴様らは……！\nちょうどいい、ここでまとめて片づけてやる！！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "教団員", "text": "ちっ……！", "face": "l5b6da4a97ede"}, {"name": "ミトラ", "text": "魔神の骨片をもった奴が森の奥に逃げたぞ！\n追ってくれ！", "face": "u276"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子！　今すぐ後を追いましょう！", "face": "l9f4f7b28a408"}]}], "active": true}